# Plentry static deploy — ALLOW-LIST (S-17, 17 Sep 2026).
# Without this file Vercel published the whole folder: edge-function source,
# SQL (RLS/trigger logic), test harness and the internal vault (doc/*.md) were
# all readable at plentry.vercel.app/<path>. Only the app assets ship now.
# Post-deploy check: curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' https://plentry.vercel.app/doc/SECURITY.md  -> 404
/*
!/index.html
!/sw.js
!/manifest.json
!/icons
!/vendor
!/vercel.json
